          "question": "e-4910",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the straight line with the canonical equation $\\dfrac{x}{5}=\\dfrac{y+3}{3}=\\dfrac{z-2}{1}.$ Find the vector equation of the line.",
